{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》於昨日（11月11日）播出第4集預告，44歲陳自瑤與昔日好姊妹傅嘉莉為爭奪馬國明爆發激 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》於昨日（11月11日）播出第4集預告，44歲陳自瑤與昔日好姊妹傅嘉莉為爭奪馬國明爆發激烈衝突。鏡頭前陳自瑤慘遭情敵連環掌摑近30巴，清脆巴掌聲震撼全網觀眾。這場充滿火藥味戲中戲背後原來暗藏極大玄機，兩位女演員極度逼真演出更意外揭開一張錯綜複雜復仇羅網。</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉於《玫瑰戰爭》連環怒摑情敵</h2>\n<p>在昨日首度曝光預告片段中，傅嘉莉飾演梁菲雅早已對馬國明飾演李德龍情根深種，卻意外揭發男方暗中與陳自瑤飾演關子盈發展地下情。兩女在劇中爆發激烈正面衝突，陳自瑤不僅毫無退縮更當面挑釁宣戰，直斥對方絕不可能與男方在一起。被妒火衝昏頭腦下，傅嘉莉瞬間目露兇光並毫不留情起手狠摑陳自瑤。在這場戲中戲拍攝情節中，傅嘉莉更借故連環NG，對陳自瑤摑完再摑，令對方慘遭狂摑近30巴，清脆巴掌聲極具壓迫感。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077478410470_8767511796af573772e5fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933985.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077478410470_8767511796af573772e5fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077659051090_10653493066af5737912624.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933986.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077659051090_10653493066af5737912624.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077815930888_14576944836af5737b27611.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933987.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077815930888_14576944836af5737b27611.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳自瑤展現專業主動要求傅嘉莉真打</h2>\n<p>面對如此火藥味濃郁場面，陳自瑤事後受訪時親自解開拍攝內幕。她笑言當時傅嘉莉在戲中戲故意NG並連環掌摑舉動太過逼真，一度嚇呆同場同劇演員楊茜堯。楊茜堯當時信以為真，誤以為兩人私底下「面和心不和」並借拍劇公報私仇，直到後來得悉純屬劇情安排才鬆一口氣。向來敬業樂業陳自瑤透露，為追求最真實畫面效果與戲劇張力，拍攝前她主動要求傅嘉莉不要遷就或留力，務求親自「真打」上陣。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078089162606_7478066626af5737db5d74.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933988.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078089162606_7478066626af5737db5d74.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>楊茜堯誓死為摯友討回公道展開復仇</h2>\n<p>除了這場令人震驚掌摑戲碼，這宗激烈衝突更將牽扯出當年轟動全城出軌風波。隨《玫瑰戰爭》劇情發展踏入白熱化階段，楊茜堯在得悉摯友枉死真相後，決定展開一連串精密復仇大計，誓要令所有背叛者付出沉重代價。預告尾聲更出現一段充滿暗示性神秘交收畫面，預示幕後黑手即將浮出水面，這場娛樂圈閨密互撕風暴才剛剛在螢幕前拉開序幕。</p>\n<h2>觀眾熱議《玫瑰戰爭》大讚演員敬業</h2>\n<p>劇集片段曝光後迅速引發網上熱烈討論，大批觀眾對這場極具衝擊力掌摑戲感到震驚。不少網民紛紛留言大讚兩位女演員表現，有人直指「連摑30巴真係睇見都覺得痛」，亦有觀眾被陳自瑤專業態度折服，表示「Yoyo為部劇真係博到盡非常敬業」。另一方面，觀眾亦對後續懸疑發展充滿期待，不斷留言猜測幕後黑手真正身分，並表示「好想快啲睇楊茜堯點樣報仇」，引發各大討論區關注。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078289269334_16839141316af57380002dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933983.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078289269334_16839141316af57380002dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078700316473_13442910976af573841d4a4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933984.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078700316473_13442910976af573841d4a4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447079104264999_21274150386af573880cab8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933991.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447079104264999_21274150386af573880cab8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%82%85%e5%98%89%e8%8e%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">傅嘉莉</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%87%aa%e7%91%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳自瑤</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3541216\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 12 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:24:01.750645+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1386,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:06:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:57:21.526858+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:28.919104+00:00","content_hash":"2b9e6f460180096352062c9b2e0377b01f2f556c51e13017a76860afd8e31927","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}